# Faymas

> Faymas is a creator platform for discovering, publishing and monetizing
> high-quality AI prompts for ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Midjourney, Veo, Runway,
> FLUX, Kling and more. Prompts are organised in a visual, Pinterest-style feed
> with likes, saves and copy tracking.

This file helps AI agents use Faymas efficiently. All public data endpoints are
read-only JSON and require no authentication.

## APIs

- [OpenAPI 3.1 description](https://faymas.in/.well-known/openapi.json): Full machine-readable contract for the public API.
- [API catalog](https://faymas.in/.well-known/api-catalog): RFC 9727 linkset pointing to the API's service-desc, service-doc and status.
- [Prompt feed](https://faymas.in/api/feed): Paginated, filterable prompt discovery (params: q, model, category, sort, authorId, cursor, limit).
- [Single prompt](https://faymas.in/api/slug-prompt): Fetch one prompt's full detail by ?slug=.
- [Health](https://faymas.in/api/health): Service status.

## Agent skills

- [Skills index](https://faymas.in/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json): Discoverable, verifiable task recipes (Agent Skills Discovery RFC v0.2.0).

## Content negotiation

- Home, prompt and profile pages return Markdown when requested with `Accept: text/markdown` (HTML remains the default for browsers).

## Pages

- [Home / feed](https://faymas.in): Browse and search prompts.
- [Prompt detail](https://faymas.in/prompt/{slug}): One prompt with full text, media and author.
- [User profile](https://faymas.in/user/{username}): A creator's prompts and stats.
- [Terms of Service](https://faymas.in/terms)
- [Privacy Policy](https://faymas.in/privacy)
- [Contact](https://faymas.in/contact)

## Notes

- Mutations (create/like/save/follow) happen through the authenticated web app and are not exposed as a public API.
- Prompt slugs appear on every feed item and form the last path segment of a prompt URL.
